[{"sha":"6e8176451d42a4c7cc3e281167abd6f4d0c1f466","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDZlODE3NjQ1MWQ0MmE0YzdjYzNlMjgxMTY3YWJkNmY0ZDBjMWY0NjY","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/6e8176451d42a4c7cc3e281167abd6f4d0c1f466","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/6e8176451d42a4c7cc3e281167abd6f4d0c1f466","author":{"name":"Igor Serganov","email":"iserganov@tunein.com","date":"2026-09-14T04:15:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"Igor Serganov","email":"iserganov@tunein.com","date":"2026-09-14T04:15:42Z"},"tree":{"sha":"572569d2f28d082fb8f9896ec9b5751ed8f1f091","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/572569d2f28d082fb8f9896ec9b5751ed8f1f091"},"message":"db: return non-NotFound errors from user lookups\n\nGetUserByID and GetUserByOIDCIdentifier only tested the query result for\ngorm.ErrRecordNotFound and then returned &user unconditionally. Any other\nfailure - a closed connection, a scan error, a cancelled query - fell\nthrough and returned a zero-valued types.User with a nil error.\n\nCreatePreAuthKey consumes GetUserByID directly and would mint a key with\nuser_id = 0 from such a result. The foreign key constraint catches that\ntoday, so the symptom is a constraint violation that points nowhere near\nthe failed read.\n\nCollapse both lookups onto a single helper that maps a missing row to\nErrUserNotFound and returns every other error unchanged.","parents":[{"sha":"4087d1fee9d34d042b279262ffbdaf1030ffd5e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/4087d1fee9d34d042b279262ffbdaf1030ffd5e8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/4087d1fee9d34d042b279262ffbdaf1030ffd5e8"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":31076472745,"node_id":"RRE_lADOEFLz888AAAABRI2l_88AAAAHPE1XqQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/31076472745","actor":{"login":"iSerganov","id"